{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大埔早上有校巴懷疑失控撞向石躉，9名學童受輕傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事校巴右邊車身，近車頭位置損毀，石躉撞至傾斜。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TP-1030_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZPYqxlm25n1791343819.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.TP-1030_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TP-1030_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026gvBIzJ5ZfR1791343815.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.TP-1030_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">校巴早上約八時半駛至富善邨外，懷疑失控撞向停車場入口的石躉。車上9名學童受傷，送往大埔那打素醫院治理。警方正調查事故原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T03:59:44.912532+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}